9T13:53:53Z","updated_at":"2026-01-28T22:19:35Z","closed_at":"2026-01-28T18:33:18Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Present in 4.4.1\n- Present in 4.6beta1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8157) - AMD Ryzen 9 3900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen you want to remove the custom layer name you gave it and leave the field blank, Godot throws an error\n\n<img width=\"327\" height=\"172\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e3e21b26-c52a-427a-a477-697547e36305\" />\n\n<img width=\"273\" height=\"147\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3baac161-6f47-4641-aa56-15c0ce530d42\" />\n\nIt should just rename it back to **Layer + whichever number layer it is**\n[AThousandShips](https://github.com/AThousandShips) called it a usability bug and asked to open a ticket instead of a proposal (https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13889)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Name a layer something\n2. Press rename -> leave the field blank\n3. Press rename and see the error\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAny project will do","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists